">Vanessa</span>: My pleasure. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: A recorder? </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Talk into it, then plug it into your laptop. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It will transcribe voice to text. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:This is such a great gift! I\u2018m going to use it every day! </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: We're so happy you like it.", "id": 2, "time": "15000", "image": "engenn6le18ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: A photo of a website? </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Your website. It comes online tomorrow. You're going to blog and vlog about cooking and recipes! The web designer is helping you out for a year. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh Sally! What can I say! It's amazing!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Glad you like it.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: A key? </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Look out the window. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: A car! </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It's nothing. Just a little lottery prize!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Get your coats on ladies! We're going to go for a spin!", "id": 3, "time": "32000", "image": "engenn6le18ob05re2img06.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le18ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le18ob05re2img07.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [], "audiosrc": "engenn6le18ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le18ob05re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "picture"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}